                                                "sense_id": "dde2a772-8a97-3e93-af96-13992eb09470",
                                                "text": "Many people believe that growth will only continue. “We’re gonna need stadiums full of electricians, heavy equipment operators, ironworkers, HVAC technicians,” Dwarkesh Patel and Romeo Dean, AI-industry analysts, wrote recently."
